// NAVIGATE is not one of the 22 verbs. It reads like one, which is exactly
// why the grammar is closed -- and why the reference implementation's own declaration
// (projects/restolean/src/model/restaurant.zui) commits this defect today.
// Navigation is LOCATE (going to a known place) or DISCOVER (finding what
// places exist).
// Expected: UNKNOWN_INTENT

DEFINE SCREEN orders_home (
  SATISFIES [NAVIGATE]
)
